    "trail_note": "Hike of about 2.5 miles one way with 1,500 feet of gain from the end of Forest Road 2411 at the trailhead (WillhiteWeb). Inland NW Routes gives 5.2 miles round trip, moderate. Snow at the trailhead at the end of FR 2411 may last until late spring."
  },
